{"1946770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fire", "steam_appid": 1946770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PLACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter an underground cave of a gargantuan size. Down there is your prize. You will need to descend platform by platform to the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/6be620bb6b778f5d3808f62103c07e6f.poster.avif?t=1786211655\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/6be620bb6b778f5d3808f62103c07e6f.webm?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/6be620bb6b778f5d3808f62103c07e6f.mp4?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your vision adapts, you notice a burning sparks in the darkness and not one but many - you are not alone. But those are creatures of the night; they fear light, they fear ~FIRE~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So cling to your torch, cling to your dear life, don't let the fire to die. Even better - nourish it, transform this place to hell itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/f017647685b8bd683242b54b30352a17.poster.avif?t=1786211655\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/f017647685b8bd683242b54b30352a17.webm?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/f017647685b8bd683242b54b30352a17.mp4?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You a miserable wretch, never to be respected. With time, you became prone to violence, this was the only way to survive, to get what you wanted.<br>One night you saw something, mesmerized you followed and found .. a place. <br>Is this a chance you always yearned for? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfold the mystery behind the place, learn the secrets of its dwellers and reach for the forbidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/2d47d7a9a5451fda7ca9a47b17f9bc5e.poster.avif?t=1786211655\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/2d47d7a9a5451fda7ca9a47b17f9bc5e.webm?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/2d47d7a9a5451fda7ca9a47b17f9bc5e.mp4?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PLACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter an underground cave of a gargantuan size. Down there is your prize. You will need to descend platform by platform to the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/6be620bb6b778f5d3808f62103c07e6f.poster.avif?t=1786211655\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/6be620bb6b778f5d3808f62103c07e6f.webm?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/6be620bb6b778f5d3808f62103c07e6f.mp4?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your vision adapts, you notice a burning sparks in the darkness and not one but many - you are not alone. But those are creatures of the night; they fear light, they fear ~FIRE~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So cling to your torch, cling to your dear life, don't let the fire to die. Even better - nourish it, transform this place to hell itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/f017647685b8bd683242b54b30352a17.poster.avif?t=1786211655\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/f017647685b8bd683242b54b30352a17.webm?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/f017647685b8bd683242b54b30352a17.mp4?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You a miserable wretch, never to be respected. With time, you became prone to violence, this was the only way to survive, to get what you wanted.<br>One night you saw something, mesmerized you followed and found .. a place. <br>Is this a chance you always yearned for? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfold the mystery behind the place, learn the secrets of its dwellers and reach for the forbidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/2d47d7a9a5451fda7ca9a47b17f9bc5e.poster.avif?t=1786211655\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/2d47d7a9a5451fda7ca9a47b17f9bc5e.webm?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/extras/2d47d7a9a5451fda7ca9a47b17f9bc5e.mp4?t=1786211655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Fire is a dark, story driven, hack and slash game. It explores themes of self loathing, and desire for a change. Combat takes place on a platforms suspended in the air, where one bad step means falling to your death. Flames are your ally, spread them to see and strike fear into your foes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/6aceb6a1c03df3a171c4eec1ef828e3bd3bf3d40/header.jpg?t=1786211655", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/2be0c84b193862de7c40baf87ce830e7b4a201dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786211655", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946770/2be0c84b193862de7c40baf87ce830e7b4a201dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786211655", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super 6GB<br></li><li><strong